OL,3,GNEWSATalks ongoing over future of hotel
OL,4,Aused for asylum seekers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe operators of a large seafront hotel
OL,7,Fwhich was used to house asylum seekers
OL,8,Fhave said "a lot of planning and
OL,9,Fdiscussion" is taking place about the
OL,10,Fvenue's future.
OL,12,FThere has been speculation about what
OL,13,Fwould happen to the Metropole Hotel in
OL,14,FBlackpool after those seeking refuge,
OL,15,Fwho were living there between September
OL,16,F2021 and July this year, left.
OL,18,FBlackpool South MP Chris Webb, who
OL,19,Fcampaigned strongly to move the
OL,20,Fmigrants to more appropriate
OL,21,Faccommodation, previously said it could
OL,22,Fonce again reopen as a tourist hotel.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
