OL,3,GNEWSATalks ongoing over future of hotel
OL,4,Aused for asylum seekers
OL,5,
OL,6,FHotel chain Britannia said "a lot of
OL,7,Fplanning and discussion is taking place
OL,8,Fbehind the scenes" but it was not yet
OL,9,Fin a position to disclose details.
